      *****************************************************************
      * CABRAT01 - RATE TABLE LOAD AND INTERNAL TABLE BUILD           *
      * APPLICATION : CABS                                            *
      * INPUTS      : DDNAME  DSN                          COPYBOOK   *
      *               RATEMST TELCABS.CABS.RATE (VSAM KSDS) CABSRATE  *
      * OUTPUTS     : DDNAME  DSN                          COPYBOOK   *
      *               RTBLOUT TELCABS.CABS.RATETBL(+1)     (LOCAL)    *
      *               RPTOUT  SYSOUT CLASS A                CABSPRNT  *
      * CONTROL     : CTLOUT                               CABSCTL    *
      * BALANCE     : CT-READ = CT-WRITTEN + CT-REJECTED +             *
      *               CT-SUMMARISED + CT-CARRIED-FWD                  *
      * RESTART     : FULL RERUN - TABLE LOAD IS NOT RESTARTABLE,     *
      *               RATEMST IS RE-BROWSED FROM LOW-VALUES EVERY RUN *
      * REVISION HISTORY                                              *
      *   V1.00  1989-06-02  R.T.WHEELER  INITIAL RELEASE - LOADS A   *
      *                      FLAT SEQUENTIAL RATE EXTRACT, VSAM CAME  *
      *                      LATER WITH THE KSDS CONVERSION           *
      *   V1.02  1991-02-14  D.OKONKWO    CONVERTED TO VSAM KSDS      *
      *                      KEYED BROWSE, SEQUENTIAL EXTRACT RETIRED *
      *   V1.05  1994-08-30  D.OKONKWO    BAND POOL FLATTENING ADDED  *
      *                      TO SAVE REGION SIZE (SEE CABSRT03)       *
      *   V1.08  1998-02-09  J.M.CASTILLO EFFECTIVE-DATE FILTER ADDED *
      *                      SO EXPIRED TARIFFS DO NOT LOAD            *
      *   V1.11  2001-11-06  P.NAIR       DUPLICATE KEY AND OVERLAP   *
      *                      DETECTION ADDED PER AUDIT FINDING 01-114 *
      *   V1.14  2005-03-22  A.BUKOWSKI   BAND CONTIGUITY GAP CHECK   *
      *                      ADDED - MILEAGE BANDS WERE SILENTLY      *
      *                      SKIPPING RANGES ON THREE TARIFF LOADS    *
      *   V1.16  2011-09-14  S.MARCHETTI  RTBLOUT INTRODUCED SO THE   *
      *                      REMAINING RATING SUITE NO LONGER BROWSES *
      *                      RATEMST DIRECTLY - CABRAT01 IS NOW THE   *
      *                      ONLY PROGRAM THAT OPENS THE VSAM KSDS    *
      *   V1.19  2019-04-30  G.PRZYBYLSKI RATE TABLE ODO EXPANDED TO  *
      *                      600 ENTRIES, BAND POOL EXPANDED TO 2400  *
      *                      TO MATCH THE REST OF THE RATING SUITE    *
      *****************************************************************
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CABRAT01.
       AUTHOR. TELCABS APPLICATIONS - RATING TEAM.
      *****************************************************************
      * RATE TABLE LOAD.  BROWSES RATEMST SEQUENTIALLY BY KEY AND      *
      * LOADS EVERY EFFECTIVE ROW INTO THE R2-RATE-TABLE OCCURS        *
      * DEPENDING ON TABLE, FLATTENING EACH ROW'S RT-BAND OCCURS       *
      * DEPENDING ON ENTRIES INTO THE SHARED R3-BAND-POOL AND          *
      * STAMPING THE OFFSET AND COUNT BACK ONTO THE PARENT ROW.  THE   *
      * FLATTENED TABLE IS WRITTEN TO RTBLOUT FOR CABRAT02-CABRAT14    *
      * TO LOAD IN TURN, SO THIS IS THE ONLY RATING PROGRAM THAT       *
      * ACTUALLY OPENS TELCABS.CABS.RATE.  THIS PROGRAM COPIES         *
      * CABSRT01, WHICH NESTS CABSRT02, WHICH NESTS CABSRT03, WHICH    *
      * NESTS CABSRT04 - FOUR LEVELS DEEP.  A CHANGE TO CABSRT04       *
      * FORCES A RECOMPILE OF THIS PROGRAM AND EVERY OTHER PROGRAM IN  *
      * THE RATING FAMILY THAT COPIES CABSRT01.                        *
      *****************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
       SPECIAL-NAMES.
           C01 IS TO-NEW-PAGE.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT RATEMST ASSIGN TO DA-RATEMST
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY IS RT-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-TABLE.
           SELECT RTBLOUT ASSIGN TO UT-S-RTBLOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-OUTPUT.
           SELECT CTLOUT ASSIGN TO UT-S-CTLOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-CONTROL.
           SELECT RPTOUT ASSIGN TO UT-S-RPTOUT
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-FS-OUTPUT.
       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
      * RATEMST - ACCESS RATE TABLE, VSAM KSDS, KEYED BROWSE ONLY.
       FD  RATEMST
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       COPY CABSRATE.
      * RTBLOUT - FLATTENED EXTRACT.  ONE 'E' ENTRY RECORD PER LOADED
      * RATEMST ROW FOLLOWED BY ITS 'B' BAND RECORDS, IF ANY.
       FD  RTBLOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 200 CHARACTERS.
       01  CABS-RTBL-RECORD.
           05  RB-REC-TYPE                 PIC X(01).
           05  RB-DETAIL                   PIC X(199).
       01  CABS-RTBL-ENTRY-REC REDEFINES CABS-RTBL-RECORD.
           05  RB-EN-REC-TYPE              PIC X(01).
           05  RB-EN-TARIFF                PIC X(04).
           05  RB-EN-ELEM                  PIC X(06).
           05  RB-EN-JURIS                 PIC X(01).
           05  RB-EN-STATE                 PIC X(02).
           05  RB-EN-EFF-YYDDD             PIC 9(05).
           05  RB-EN-EXP-YYDDD             PIC 9(05).
           05  RB-EN-INITIAL               PIC S9(05)V9(05).
           05  RB-EN-ADDL                  PIC S9(05)V9(05).
           05  RB-EN-SETUP                 PIC S9(07)V9(05).
           05  RB-EN-MIN-CHG               PIC S9(07)V9(02).
           05  RB-EN-MAX-CHG               PIC S9(11)V9(02).
           05  RB-EN-ROUND-RULE            PIC X(01).
           05  RB-EN-ROUND-POS             PIC 9(01).
           05  RB-EN-INIT-PERIOD           PIC 9(04).
           05  RB-EN-ADDL-PERIOD           PIC 9(04).
           05  RB-EN-BAND-CNT              PIC 9(02).
           05  RB-EN-BAND-OFFSET           PIC 9(04).
           05  RB-EN-MODULE-SFX            PIC X(02).
           05  RB-EN-FILLER                PIC X(104).
       01  CABS-RTBL-BAND-REC REDEFINES CABS-RTBL-RECORD.
           05  RB-BD-REC-TYPE              PIC X(01).
           05  RB-BD-TARIFF                PIC X(04).
           05  RB-BD-ELEM                  PIC X(06).
           05  RB-BD-JURIS                 PIC X(01).
           05  RB-BD-STATE                 PIC X(02).
           05  RB-BD-EFF-YYDDD             PIC 9(05).
           05  RB-BD-BAND-SEQ              PIC 9(02).
           05  RB-BD-BAND-FROM             PIC S9(11).
           05  RB-BD-BAND-THRU             PIC S9(11).
           05  RB-BD-BAND-RATE             PIC S9(05)V9(05).
           05  RB-BD-BAND-PCT              PIC S9(03)V9(05).
           05  RB-BD-FILLER                PIC X(139).
      * CTLOUT - RUN CONTROL / BALANCING RECORD.
       FD  CTLOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS F
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 180 CHARACTERS.
       01  CABS-CTLOUT-RECORD              PIC X(180).
      * RPTOUT - RATE TABLE AUDIT REPORT.
       FD  RPTOUT
           RECORDING MODE IS FA
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           BLOCK CONTAINS 0 RECORDS
           RECORD CONTAINS 133 CHARACTERS.
       COPY CABSPRNT.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      * STANDARD SHARED WORKING STORAGE.  SEE CABSWRK.
       COPY CABSWRK.
      * RATING FAMILY CONTROL BLOCKS - ONE COPY PULLS IN THE RUN
      * CONTROL BLOCK, THE RATE TABLE, THE BAND POOL AND THE
      * ROUNDING WORK AREA (CABSRT01 NESTS RT02, RT03 AND RT04).
       COPY CABSRT01.
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONSTANTS.
           05  WS-PGM-NAME                 PIC X(08) VALUE 'CABRAT01'.
           05  WS-PGM-VERSION              PIC X(05) VALUE 'V1.19'.
           05  WS-MAX-ENTRIES              PIC S9(04) COMP-3
                                                        VALUE 600.
           05  WS-MAX-BANDS                PIC S9(04) COMP-3
                                                        VALUE 2400.
      * SYSIN PARM CARD - CYCLE DATE DRIVES THE EFFECTIVE-DATE
      * FILTER.  POSITIONAL LAYOUT ONLY.
       01  WS-PARM-CARD                    PIC X(80).
       01  WS-PARM-CARD-R1 REDEFINES WS-PARM-CARD.
           05  PC1-CYCLE-YYDDD              PIC 9(05).
           05  PC1-TARIFF-CD                PIC X(04).
           05  PC1-RUN-ID                   PIC X(12).
           05  PC1-FILLER                   PIC X(59).
       01  WS-EV-CYCLE-VIEW.
           05  WS-EV-CYCLE-YYDDD           PIC 9(05) VALUE 0.
           05  WS-EV-CYCLE-CCYYDDD         PIC 9(07) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-EFF-FILTER-WORK.
           05  WS-EFF-OK-SW                PIC X(01) VALUE 'Y'.
               88  WS-EFF-DATE-OK          VALUE 'Y'.
               88  WS-EFF-DATE-BAD         VALUE 'N'.
      * DUPLICATE-KEY DETECTION - A TRUE KSDS CANNOT PHYSICALLY HOLD
      * A DUPLICATE PRIMARY KEY, BUT THIS GUARD HAS BEEN CARRIED
      * SINCE V1.11 AGAINST A CORRUPT ALTERNATE-PATH REORG.
       01  WS-KEY-DISPLAY-WORK.
           05  WS-PREV-FULL-KEY            PIC X(18) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-KEY-DISPLAY-R REDEFINES WS-KEY-DISPLAY-WORK.
           05  WS-KD-TARIFF                PIC X(04).
           05  WS-KD-ELEM                  PIC X(06).
           05  WS-KD-JURIS                 PIC X(01).
           05  WS-KD-STATE                 PIC X(02).
           05  WS-KD-EFF                   PIC 9(05).
      * OVERLAP DETECTION - REMEMBERS THE PREVIOUS ROW'S KEY MINUS
      * THE EFFECTIVE DATE PLUS ITS EXPIRY, SO A LATER ROW SHARING
      * THAT KEY WHOSE EFFECTIVE DATE FALLS ON OR BEFORE THE PRIOR
      * ROW'S EXPIRY IS FLAGGED AS AN OVERLAPPING DATE RANGE.
       01  WS-PREV-NOKEY-WORK.
           05  WS-PREV-NOKEY-TARIFF        PIC X(04) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-PREV-NOKEY-ELEM          PIC X(06) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-PREV-NOKEY-JURIS         PIC X(01) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-PREV-NOKEY-STATE         PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
           05  WS-PREV-EXP-YYDDD           PIC 9(05) VALUE 0.
      * BAND CONTIGUITY WORK - WALKS THE RAW RT-BAND TABLE BEFORE
      * FLATTENING, BAND N THRU + 1 MUST EQUAL BAND N+1 FROM.
       01  WS-BAND-CONTIG-WORK.
           05  WS-BC-SUB                   PIC S9(02) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-BC-NEXT-SUB              PIC S9(02) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-BC-LIMIT                 PIC S9(02) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-BC-EXPECT-FROM           PIC S9(11) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
      * EXCEPTION COUNTERS - PRINTED ON THE AUDIT REPORT ONLY, NOT
      * FED INTO THE BALANCING EQUATION.  NONE STOP THE LOAD.
       01  WS-EXCEPTION-COUNTERS.
           05  WS-DUP-CNT                  PIC S9(05) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-OVERLAP-CNT              PIC S9(05) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-GAP-CNT                  PIC S9(05) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-EFF-SKIP-CNT             PIC S9(05) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-FULL-SKIP-CNT            PIC S9(05) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       01  WS-BAND-WRITE-WORK.
           05  WS-WB-SUB                   PIC S9(04) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-WB-POOL-SUB              PIC S9(04) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-BAND-REC-WRITTEN-CNT     PIC S9(05) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       01  WS-TABLE-LOAD-COUNTERS.
           05  WS-TL-RATE-ROWS-LOADED      PIC S9(05) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-TL-BAND-ROWS-LOADED      PIC S9(05) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       01  WS-ABEND-WORK.
           05  WS-AB-PGM                   PIC X(08).
           05  WS-AB-PARA                  PIC X(30).
           05  WS-AB-REASON                PIC X(60).
           05  WS-AB-USER-CODE             PIC 9(04) VALUE 9901.
       01  WS-EXT-CALL-RC.
           05  WS-RC-DTCNV                 PIC 9(04) VALUE 0.
           05  WS-RC-HASH                  PIC 9(04) VALUE 0.
           05  WS-RC-PARMR                 PIC 9(04) VALUE 0.
           05  WS-RC-ABEND                 PIC 9(04) VALUE 0.
       01  WS-REPORT-WORK.
           05  WS-RPT-PAGE-NBR             PIC S9(03) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-RPT-LINE-NBR             PIC S9(03) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-RPT-TITLE1                PIC X(60) VALUE
               'CABRAT01 - RATE TABLE LOAD AND AUDIT REPORT'.
           05  WS-RPT-TITLE2                PIC X(60) VALUE
               'TELCABS WHOLESALE ACCESS BILLING - RATING SUITE'.
      * CABHASH ACCUMULATES A CONTROL-BREAK HASH ON EACH ACCEPTED
      * KEY SO A RECONCILIATION JOB CAN CONFIRM RTBLOUT MATCHES.
       01  WS-HASH-WORK.
           05  WS-HW-OCN                   PIC S9(15) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
           05  WS-HW-SEQ                   PIC S9(17) COMP-3 VALUE 0.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
      * P0000-MAINLINE - MANDATORY CABS BATCH SHAPE.  EACH PASS OF
      * P2000-PROCESS LOADS EXACTLY ONE RATEMST ROW.
       P0000-MAINLINE.
           PERFORM P1000-INIT THRU P1000-EXIT.
           PERFORM P2000-PROCESS THRU P2000-EXIT UNTIL WS-EOF.
           PERFORM P8000-CONTROL THRU P8000-EXIT.
           PERFORM P9000-TERM THRU P9000-EXIT.
           STOP RUN.
      * S100-INITIALISATION SECTION
       S100-INITIALISATION SECTION.
       P1000-INIT.
           PERFORM P1100-OPEN-FILES THRU P1100-EXIT.
           PERFORM P1200-READ-PARM THRU P1200-EXIT.
           PERFORM P1400-START-BROWSE THRU P1400-EXIT.
       P1000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
       P1100-OPEN-FILES.
           OPEN INPUT RATEMST.
           IF WS-FS-TABLE NOT = '00'
               MOVE 'P1100-OPEN-FILES' TO WS-AB-PARA
               MOVE 'RATEMST OPEN FAILED - VSAM STATUS BAD' TO
                   WS-AB-REASON
               PERFORM P9900-FATAL-OPEN THRU P9900-EXIT.
           OPEN OUTPUT RTBLOUT.
           IF WS-FS-OUTPUT NOT = '00'
               MOVE 'P1100-OPEN-FILES' TO WS-AB-PARA
               MOVE 'RTBLOUT OPEN FAILED - FILE STATUS BAD' TO
                   WS-AB-REASON
               PERFORM P9900-FATAL-OPEN THRU P9900-EXIT.
           OPEN OUTPUT CTLOUT.
           IF WS-FS-CONTROL NOT = '00'
               MOVE 'P1100-OPEN-FILES' TO WS-AB-PARA
               MOVE 'CTLOUT OPEN FAILED - FILE STATUS BAD' TO
                   WS-AB-REASON
               PERFORM P9900-FATAL-OPEN THRU P9900-EXIT.
           OPEN OUTPUT RPTOUT.
           IF WS-FS-OUTPUT NOT = '00'
               MOVE 'P1100-OPEN-FILES' TO WS-AB-PARA
               MOVE 'RPTOUT OPEN FAILED - FILE STATUS BAD' TO
                   WS-AB-REASON
               PERFORM P9900-FATAL-OPEN THRU P9900-EXIT.
       P1100-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      * P1200-READ-PARM - CONVERTS THE TWO-DIGIT-YEAR CYCLE TO A
      * CENTURY VIEW VIA CABDTCNV, PIVOTING ON DW-PIVOT-YY, AND
      * PRIMES ALL LOCAL COUNTERS AND THE VSAM BROWSE KEY.
       P1200-READ-PARM.
           MOVE SPACES TO WS-PARM-CARD.
           ACCEPT WS-PARM-CARD FROM SYSIN.
           CALL 'CABPARMR' USING WS-PARM-CARD WS-RC-PARMR.
           MOVE PC1-CYCLE-YYDDD TO WS-EV-CYCLE-YYDDD.
           MOVE PC1-CYCLE-YYDDD TO DW-CUR-YY DW-CUR-DDD.
           COMPUTE WS-EV-CYCLE-CCYYDDD = 19000000 + PC1-CYCLE-YYDDD.
           IF DW-CUR-YY < DW-PIVOT-YY
               COMPUTE WS-EV-CYCLE-CCYYDDD = 20000000 + PC1-CYCLE-YYDDD.
           CALL 'CABDTCNV' USING WS-EV-CYCLE-CCYYDDD DW-GREG-DATE
               WS-RC-DTCNV.
           MOVE 0 TO R2-ENTRY-CNT.
           MOVE 0 TO R3-POOL-CNT.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-DUP-CNT WS-OVERLAP-CNT WS-GAP-CNT.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-EFF-SKIP-CNT WS-FULL-SKIP-CNT.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-BAND-REC-WRITTEN-CNT.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-HW-OCN WS-HW-SEQ.
       P1200-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      * P1400-START-BROWSE - POSITIONS THE VSAM CURSOR AT THE LOWEST
      * KEY AND PRIMES THE FIRST READ.
       P1400-START-BROWSE.
           MOVE LOW-VALUES TO RT-KEY.
           START RATEMST KEY NOT LESS THAN RT-KEY
               INVALID KEY MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF-SW.
           IF NOT WS-EOF
               PERFORM P2100-READ-NEXT-RATE THRU P2100-EXIT.
       P1400-EXIT.
           EXIT.
       P9900-FATAL-OPEN.
           MOVE WS-PGM-NAME TO WS-AB-PGM.
           CALL 'CABABEND' USING WS-AB-PGM WS-AB-PARA WS-AB-REASON
               WS-AB-USER-CODE WS-RC-ABEND.
       P9900-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      * S200-TABLE-LOAD SECTION - ONE PASS PER RATEMST ROW.
       S200-TABLE-LOAD SECTION.
       P2000-PROCESS.
           ADD 1 TO WS-READ-CNT.
           PERFORM P2200-APPLY-EFF-DATE-FILTER THRU P2200-EXIT.
           IF WS-EFF-DATE-OK
               PERFORM P2300-CHECK-DUPLICATE-KEY THRU P2300-EXIT
               PERFORM P2400-CHECK-OVERLAP-RANGE THRU P2400-EXIT
               PERFORM P2700-CHECK-BAND-CONTIGUITY THRU P2700-EXIT
               PERFORM P2500-LOAD-RATE-ROW THRU P2500-EXIT
           ELSE
               ADD 1 TO WS-EFF-SKIP-CNT
               ADD 1 TO WS-REJECT-CNT.
           PERFORM P2100-READ-NEXT-RATE THRU P2100-EXIT.
       P2000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
       P2100-READ-NEXT-RATE.
           IF NOT WS-EOF
               READ RATEMST NEXT RECORD
                   AT END MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EOF-SW.
       P2100-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      * P2200-APPLY-EFF-DATE-FILTER - SKIPS A ROW NOT YET EFFECTIVE
      * OR ALREADY EXPIRED.  AN EXPIRY OF ZERO IS OPEN-ENDED.
       P2200-APPLY-EFF-DATE-FILTER.
           MOVE 'Y' TO WS-EFF-OK-SW.
           IF RT-EFF-YYDDD > WS-EV-CYCLE-YYDDD
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-EFF-OK-SW.
           IF RT-EXP-YYDDD NOT = 0 AND
                   RT-EXP-YYDDD < WS-EV-CYCLE-YYDDD
               MOVE 'N' TO WS-EFF-OK-SW.
       P2200-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      * P2500-LOAD-RATE-ROW - THE ODO PRODUCER.  THE DEPENDING-ON
      * ITEM (R2-ENTRY-CNT) IS INCREMENTED AND THE INDEX SET FROM IT
      * BEFORE ANY R2-ENTRY (R2-EX) REFERENCE, AND THE BAND OFFSET
      * IS STAMPED ONLY AFTER THE POOL LOAD COMPLETES.
       P2500-LOAD-RATE-ROW.
           IF R2-ENTRY-CNT NOT < WS-MAX-ENTRIES
               MOVE 'Y' TO R2-TABLE-FULL-SW
               ADD 1 TO WS-FULL-SKIP-CNT
               ADD 1 TO WS-REJECT-CNT
           ELSE
               ADD 1 TO R2-ENTRY-CNT
               SET R2-EX TO R2-ENTRY-CNT
               MOVE RT-TARIFF-CD TO R2-EN-TARIFF (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-RATE-ELEM TO R2-EN-ELEM (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-JURIS-CD TO R2-EN-JURIS (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-STATE-CD TO R2-EN-STATE (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-EFF-YYDDD TO R2-EN-EFF-YYDDD (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-INITIAL-RATE TO R2-EN-INITIAL (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-ADDL-RATE TO R2-EN-ADDL (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-SETUP-CHG TO R2-EN-SETUP (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-MIN-CHG TO R2-EN-MIN-CHG (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-MAX-CHG TO R2-EN-MAX-CHG (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-ROUND-RULE TO R2-EN-ROUND-RULE (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-ROUND-POS TO R2-EN-ROUND-POS (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-INIT-PERIOD TO R2-EN-INIT-PERIOD (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-ADDL-PERIOD TO R2-EN-ADDL-PERIOD (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-EXP-YYDDD TO R2-EN-EXP-YYDDD (R2-EX)
               MOVE RT-BAND-CNT TO R2-EN-BAND-CNT (R2-EX)
               MOVE SPACES TO R2-EN-MODULE-SFX (R2-EX)
               PERFORM P2600-LOAD-BAND-ROWS THRU P2600-EXIT
               PERFORM P2800-WRITE-ENTRY-RECORD THRU P2800-EXIT
               CALL 'CABHASH' USING RT-STATE-CD WS-HW-OCN
               ADD RT-EFF-YYDDD TO WS-HW-SEQ
               ADD 1 TO WS-TL-RATE-ROWS-LOADED
               ADD 1 TO WS-WRITE-CNT.
       P2500-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      * P2600-LOAD-BAND-ROWS - FLATTENS RT-BAND (INPUT ODO) INTO
      * R3-BAND-POOL (OUTPUT ODO), RECORDING THE STARTING OFFSET.
       P2600-LOAD-BAND-ROWS.
           ADD 1 TO R3-POOL-CNT.
           MOVE R3-POOL-CNT TO R2-EN-BAND-OFFSET (R2-EX).
           SUBTRACT 1 FROM R3-POOL-CNT.
           IF RT-BAND-CNT > 0
               PERFORM P2610-LOAD-ONE-BAND THRU P2610-EXIT
                   VARYING RT-BX FROM 1 BY 1
                   UNTIL RT-BX > RT-BAND-CNT.
       P2600-EXIT.
           EXIT.
       P2610-LOAD-ONE-BAND.
           IF R3-POOL-CNT < WS-MAX-BANDS
               ADD 1 TO R3-POOL-CNT
               SET R3-PX TO R3-POOL-CNT
               MOVE RT-BAND-FROM (RT-BX) TO R3-PL-FROM (R3-PX)
               MOVE RT-BAND-THRU (RT-BX) TO R3-PL-THRU (R3-PX)
               MOVE RT-BAND-RATE (RT-BX) TO R3-PL-RATE (R3-PX)
               MOVE RT-BAND-PCT (RT-BX) TO R3-PL-PCT (R3-PX)
               ADD 1 TO WS-TL-BAND-ROWS-LOADED.
       P2610-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      * P2800-WRITE-ENTRY-RECORD - WRITES THE 'E' RECORD THEN ITS
      * 'B' BAND RECORDS FROM THE POOL SLICE JUST LOADED.
       P2800-WRITE-ENTRY-RECORD.
           MOVE 'E' TO RB-EN-REC-TYPE.
           MOVE R2-EN-TARIFF (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-TARIFF.
           MOVE R2-EN-ELEM (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-ELEM.
           MOVE R2-EN-JURIS (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-JURIS.
           MOVE R2-EN-STATE (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-STATE.
           MOVE R2-EN-EFF-YYDDD (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-EFF-YYDDD.
           MOVE R2-EN-EXP-YYDDD (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-EXP-YYDDD.
           MOVE R2-EN-INITIAL (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-INITIAL.
           MOVE R2-EN-ADDL (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-ADDL.
           MOVE R2-EN-SETUP (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-SETUP.
           MOVE R2-EN-MIN-CHG (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-MIN-CHG.
           MOVE R2-EN-MAX-CHG (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-MAX-CHG.
           MOVE R2-EN-ROUND-RULE (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-ROUND-RULE.
           MOVE R2-EN-ROUND-POS (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-ROUND-POS.
           MOVE R2-EN-INIT-PERIOD (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-INIT-PERIOD.
           MOVE R2-EN-ADDL-PERIOD (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-ADDL-PERIOD.
           MOVE R2-EN-BAND-CNT (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-BAND-CNT.
           MOVE R2-EN-BAND-OFFSET (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-BAND-OFFSET.
           MOVE R2-EN-MODULE-SFX (R2-EX) TO RB-EN-MODULE-SFX.
           MOVE SPACES TO RB-EN-FILLER.
           WRITE CABS-RTBL-RECORD.
           PERFORM P2810-WRITE-BAND-RECORDS THRU P2810-EXIT.
       P2800-EXIT.
           EXIT.
       P2810-WRITE-BAND-RECORDS.
           IF R2-EN-BAND-CNT (R2-EX) > 0
               PERFORM P2820-WRITE-ONE-BAND-RECORD THRU P2820-EXIT
                   VARYING WS-WB-SUB FROM 1 BY 1
                   UNTIL WS-WB-SUB > R2-EN-BAND-CNT (R2-EX).
       P2810-EXIT.
           EXIT.
       P2820-WRITE-ONE-BAND-RECORD.
           COMPUTE WS-WB-POOL-SUB =
               R2-EN-BAND-OFFSET (R2-EX) + WS-WB-SUB - 1.
           SET R3-PX TO WS-WB-POOL-SUB.
           MOVE 'B' TO RB-BD-REC-TYPE.
           MOVE R2-EN-TARIFF (R2-EX) TO RB-BD-TARIFF.
           MOVE R2-EN-ELEM (R2-EX) TO RB-BD-ELEM.
           MOVE R2-EN-JURIS (R2-EX) TO RB-BD-JURIS.
           MOVE R2-EN-STATE (R2-EX) TO RB-BD-STATE.
           MOVE R2-EN-EFF-YYDDD (R2-EX) TO RB-BD-EFF-YYDDD.
           MOVE WS-WB-SUB TO RB-BD-BAND-SEQ.
           MOVE R3-PL-FROM (R3-PX) TO RB-BD-BAND-FROM.
           MOVE R3-PL-THRU (R3-PX) TO RB-BD-BAND-THRU.
           MOVE R3-PL-RATE (R3-PX) TO RB-BD-BAND-RATE.
           MOVE R3-PL-PCT (R3-PX) TO RB-BD-BAND-PCT.
           MOVE SPACES TO RB-BD-FILLER.
           WRITE CABS-RTBL-RECORD.
           ADD 1 TO WS-BAND-REC-WRITTEN-CNT.
       P2820-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      * S250-KEY-VALIDATION SECTION - DUPLICATE AND OVERLAP CHECKS.
       S250-KEY-VALIDATION SECTION.
      * P2300-CHECK-DUPLICATE-KEY - RATEMST ARRIVES IN ASCENDING KEY
      * SEQUENCE, SO A DUPLICATE SHOWS UP ON CONSECUTIVE ROWS.
       P2300-CHECK-DUPLICATE-KEY.
           IF RT-KEY = WS-PREV-FULL-KEY
               ADD 1 TO WS-DUP-CNT.
           MOVE RT-KEY TO WS-PREV-FULL-KEY.
       P2300-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      * P2400-CHECK-OVERLAP-RANGE - SAME NON-DATE KEY AS THE PREVIOUS
      * ROW, EFFECTIVE ON OR BEFORE THE PREVIOUS ROW'S EXPIRY.
       P2400-CHECK-OVERLAP-RANGE.
           IF RT-TARIFF-CD = WS-PREV-NOKEY-TARIFF AND
                   RT-RATE-ELEM = WS-PREV-NOKEY-ELEM AND
                   RT-JURIS-CD = WS-PREV-NOKEY-JURIS AND
                   RT-STATE-CD = WS-PREV-NOKEY-STATE AND
                   (WS-PREV-EXP-YYDDD = 0 OR
                    WS-PREV-EXP-YYDDD NOT < RT-EFF-YYDDD)
               ADD 1 TO WS-OVERLAP-CNT.
           MOVE RT-TARIFF-CD TO WS-PREV-NOKEY-TARIFF.
           MOVE RT-RATE-ELEM TO WS-PREV-NOKEY-ELEM.
           MOVE RT-JURIS-CD TO WS-PREV-NOKEY-JURIS.
           MOVE RT-STATE-CD TO WS-PREV-NOKEY-STATE.
           MOVE RT-EXP-YYDDD TO WS-PREV-EXP-YYDDD.
       P2400-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      * S300-BAND-VALIDATION SECTION - CONTIGUITY CHECK ON THE RAW
      * RT-BAND TABLE BEFORE IT IS FLATTENED INTO THE POOL.
       S300-BAND-VALIDATION SECTION.
      * P2700-CHECK-BAND-CONTIGUITY - REPORTED, NOT REJECTED - THE
      * ROW STILL LOADS AS RATEMST DELIVERED IT.
       P2700-CHECK-BAND-CONTIGUITY.
           IF RT-BAND-CNT > 1
               COMPUTE WS-BC-LIMIT = RT-BAND-CNT - 1
               PERFORM P2710-CHECK-ONE-GAP THRU P2710-EXIT
                   VARYING WS-BC-SUB FROM 1 BY 1
                   UNTIL WS-BC-SUB > WS-BC-LIMIT.
       P2700-EXIT.
           EXIT.
       P2710-CHECK-ONE-GAP.
           COMPUTE WS-BC-NEXT-SUB = WS-BC-SUB + 1.
           COMPUTE WS-BC-EXPECT-FROM = RT-BAND-THRU (WS-BC-SUB) + 1.
           IF WS-BC-EXPECT-FROM NOT = RT-BAND-FROM (WS-BC-NEXT-SUB)
               ADD 1 TO WS-GAP-CNT.
       P2710-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      * S800-CONTROL-BALANCE SECTION.
       S800-CONTROL-BALANCE SECTION.
       P8000-CONTROL.
           PERFORM P8010-PRINT-AUDIT-REPORT THRU P8010-EXIT.
           PERFORM P8100-BUILD-CONTROL-REC THRU P8100-EXIT.
           PERFORM P8200-CHECK-BALANCE THRU P8200-EXIT.
           PERFORM P8300-WRITE-CONTROL-REC THRU P8300-EXIT.
       P8000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
       P8010-PRINT-AUDIT-REPORT.
           ADD 1 TO WS-RPT-PAGE-NBR.
           MOVE SPACES TO CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE '1' TO PC-CC.
           MOVE WS-RPT-TITLE1 TO PC-TEXT.
           WRITE CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE SPACES TO CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE ' ' TO PC-CC.
           MOVE WS-RPT-TITLE2 TO PC-TEXT.
           WRITE CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE SPACES TO CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE ' ' TO PC-CC.
           MOVE 'CYCLE YYDDD:' TO PC-COL-001-020.
           MOVE WS-EV-CYCLE-YYDDD TO PC-COL-021-060.
           WRITE CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE SPACES TO CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           WRITE CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE SPACES TO CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE ' ' TO PC-CC.
           MOVE 'RATE ROWS LOADED' TO PC-COL-001-020.
           MOVE WS-TL-RATE-ROWS-LOADED TO PC-COL-021-060.
           WRITE CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE SPACES TO CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE ' ' TO PC-CC.
           MOVE 'BAND ROWS LOADED' TO PC-COL-001-020.
           MOVE WS-TL-BAND-ROWS-LOADED TO PC-COL-021-060.
           WRITE CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE SPACES TO CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE ' ' TO PC-CC.
           MOVE 'ROWS SKIPPED - EFF DATE' TO PC-COL-001-020.
           MOVE WS-EFF-SKIP-CNT TO PC-COL-021-060.
           WRITE CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE SPACES TO CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE ' ' TO PC-CC.
           MOVE 'ROWS SKIPPED - TABLE FULL' TO PC-COL-001-020.
           MOVE WS-FULL-SKIP-CNT TO PC-COL-021-060.
           WRITE CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE SPACES TO CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE ' ' TO PC-CC.
           MOVE 'EXACT DUPLICATE KEYS' TO PC-COL-001-020.
           MOVE WS-DUP-CNT TO PC-COL-021-060.
           WRITE CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE SPACES TO CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE ' ' TO PC-CC.
           MOVE 'OVERLAPPING DATE RANGES' TO PC-COL-001-020.
           MOVE WS-OVERLAP-CNT TO PC-COL-021-060.
           WRITE CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE SPACES TO CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE ' ' TO PC-CC.
           MOVE 'BAND CONTIGUITY GAPS' TO PC-COL-001-020.
           MOVE WS-GAP-CNT TO PC-COL-021-060.
           WRITE CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE SPACES TO CABS-PRINT-LINE.
           MOVE ' ' TO PC-CC.
           IF R2-TABLE-FULL
               MOVE '*** RATE TABLE FULL - SOME ROWS DROPPED ***' TO
                   PC-TEXT
           ELSE
               MOVE 'RATE TABLE NOT FULL' TO PC-TEXT.
           WRITE CABS-PRINT-LINE.
       P8010-EXIT.
           EXIT.
       P8100-BUILD-CONTROL-REC.
           MOVE PC1-RUN-ID TO CT-RUN-ID.
           MOVE WS-PGM-NAME TO CT-PROCESS-ID.
           MOVE 1 TO CT-STEP-SEQ.
           MOVE WS-EV-CYCLE-YYDDD TO CT-CYCLE-YYDDD.
           MOVE 0 TO CT-BILL-PERIOD.
           MOVE 0 TO CT-RERUN-NBR.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-JOBNAME.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-STEPNAME.
           MOVE WS-READ-CNT TO CT-READ.
           MOVE WS-WRITE-CNT TO CT-WRITTEN.
           MOVE WS-REJECT-CNT TO CT-REJECTED.
           MOVE 0 TO CT-SUMMARISED.
           MOVE 0 TO CT-CARRIED-FWD.
           MOVE 0 TO CT-HASH-MINUTES.
           MOVE 0 TO CT-HASH-AMOUNT.
           MOVE WS-HW-SEQ TO CT-HASH-SEQ.
           MOVE WS-HW-OCN TO CT-HASH-OCN.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-RESTART-KEY.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-FILLER.
           MOVE 0 TO CT-RC.
           MOVE SPACES TO CT-ABEND-CD.
       P8100-EXIT.
           EXIT.
       P8200-CHECK-BALANCE.
           IF CT-READ = CT-WRITTEN + CT-REJECTED + CT-SUMMARISED +
                   CT-CARRIED-FWD
               MOVE 'B' TO CT-BAL-IND
           ELSE
               MOVE 'O' TO CT-BAL-IND.
       P8200-EXIT.
           EXIT.
       P8300-WRITE-CONTROL-REC.
           MOVE CABS-CONTROL-RECORD TO CABS-CTLOUT-RECORD.
           WRITE CABS-CTLOUT-RECORD.
       P8300-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      * S900-TERMINATION SECTION.
       S900-TERMINATION SECTION.
       P9000-TERM.
           CLOSE RATEMST.
           CLOSE RTBLOUT.
           CLOSE CTLOUT.
           CLOSE RPTOUT.
           DISPLAY 'CABRAT01 - RUN COMPLETE'.
           DISPLAY '  READ        = ' WS-READ-CNT.
           DISPLAY '  ENTRIES OUT = ' WS-WRITE-CNT.
           DISPLAY '  BANDS OUT   = ' WS-BAND-REC-WRITTEN-CNT.
           DISPLAY '  REJECTED    = ' WS-REJECT-CNT.
           DISPLAY '  DUPLICATES  = ' WS-DUP-CNT.
           DISPLAY '  OVERLAPS    = ' WS-OVERLAP-CNT.
           DISPLAY '  BAND GAPS   = ' WS-GAP-CNT.
       P9000-EXIT.
           EXIT.
